# Minimize `style` — NativeWind first

This app uses **NativeWind** (`className`). Prefer utilities for layout, spacing, typography, and brand colors from `tailwind.config.js` (`bg-whiskey-bg`, `bg-whiskey-surface`, `text-whiskey-accent`, `text-whiskey-textSecondary`, `border-whiskey-accent`, etc.).

## Do not use `style` for

- Font size, weight, family — use `text-*` and `Text` variants
- Padding, margin, flex — use Tailwind utilities
- Static colors — use the `whiskey-*` tokens

## `style` is acceptable only for

- **Measurements**: `onLayout` results, image aspect ratios, and other runtime sizes not covered by utilities
- **Animated values**: Reanimated / animated styles

## Examples

```tsx
// Prefer
<Text className="text-xs text-whiskey-textSecondary">Label</Text>

// Avoid duplicating what utilities already encode
<Text className="text-xs" style={{ fontSize: 12 }} /> // redundant

// OK — height comes from a measurement
<View className="bg-whiskey-surface" style={{ height: measuredHeight }} />
```

When adding `style`, add a **short comment** only if the reason is non-obvious.
